ub.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing release export templates (`production=yes lto=full`).\r\n\r\nStripped binary size:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmaster:  72,105,688 bytes\r\nThis PR: 71,806,616 bytes\r\n```\r\n\r\nTPS demo startup and shutdown times:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ hyperfine -m50 -iw1 \\\r\n\"bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.master --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit\" \\\r\n\"bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.master --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      2.352 s ±  0.396 s    [User: 0.390 s, System: 0.457 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    1.645 s …  2.754 s    50 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      2.285 s ±  0.418 s    [User: 0.383 s, System: 0.454 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    1.626 s …  2.719 s    50 runs\r\n \r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit ran\r\n    1.03 ± 0.26 times faster than bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.master --path ~/Documents/Godot/tps-demo --audio-driver Dummy --quit\r\n```","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182#pullrequestreview-2688481330","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104182","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182#pullrequestreview-2688481330"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104182"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-16T01:30:11Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2691300313,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gafvZ","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Nice catch !","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182#pullrequestreview-2691300313","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot